# Active Directory Configuration

## Forest & Domain

| Item              | Value                       |
| ----------------- | --------------------------- |
| Forest root       | `kbr.local`                 |
| Domain            | `kbr.local`                 |
| Functional level  | Windows Server 2016 or later|
| Domain controller | `KBR-DC01`                  |
| DC OS             | Windows Server 2022         |
| DC address (Ops)  | `172.16.10.10`              |

DNS is integrated into AD and runs on the DC. The DC is the only authoritative resolver for `kbr.local`.

## Promotion Steps (Summary)

```powershell
Install-WindowsFeature AD-Domain-Services -IncludeManagementTools
Install-ADDSForest `
  -DomainName "kbr.local" `
  -DomainNetbiosName "KBR" `
  -InstallDns `
  -ForestMode "WinThreshold" `
  -DomainMode "WinThreshold" `
  -SafeModeAdministratorPassword (Read-Host -AsSecureString "DSRM password")
```

The DSRM password is **not** stored in the repository. Set it interactively.

